<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>in the women's World Open squash championship on Saturday:</p>
<p>4-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 5-Liz Irving (Australia) 9-5</p>
<p>9-6 4-9 4-9 10-8</p>
<p>2-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 7-Sue Wright (England) 9-3</p>
<p>9-4 9-1</p>
</text>
